  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEET FRANCISCA: A girl with a desire to progress</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Francisca&apos;s (18) life changed in 2008, when her father abandoned her family. &quot;After that, my childhood is over. When would I go to high school if I had to take care of my siblings and clean the house?&quot; she says. She spent almost three years without going to school, her days were divided into cleaning, cooking and taking her brothers to school. Thanks to Hogar de Cristo, she is now back to school. We need your support to continue helping young women like Francisca</narrative>
  </description>
